<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A successful move is more than copying a folder. You need to know which files, applications and everyday tasks matter, what is ready to move, and what still needs attention. Start with an inventory before changing either computer.</p>
{% include "components/guide-start.njk" %}
