<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Keep passwords and recovery codes in your control. Do not send them in an enquiry form or attach them to this checklist. If someone else will use the computer, record that as a scope question rather than assuming every profile is included.</p>
<h2 class="mt-12 mb-5 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">Check the starting condition</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Can the old computer start normally and read the files you want to move? Is there a usable backup? Is the new device the platform you expected? If the answer is uncertain, explain that before booking.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Windows Backup is one Microsoft option to understand, but it is not a promise that every file, application or setting will be recreated. Review <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/experience/backup-recovery/back-up-and-restore-with-windows-backup">Microsoft's backup and restore guidance</a> against your circumstances. Do not assume a visible cloud icon proves every important item is protected.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">This preparation guide does not ask you to start a transfer or erase anything. If the source will not start, storage is inaccessible or a recovery prompt is unfamiliar, pause for assessment.</p>
<h2 class="mt-12 mb-5 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">Does the standard move fit?</h2>
<aside class="guide-service" aria-label="Service scope and next step"><p class="guide-kicker">If you would like help</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Naked Tech's <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/services/new-computer-setup-data-transfer-ivanhoe/">Standard Windows Move</a> is <strong>$550 including GST</strong> for one primary user moving up to <strong>250 GB</strong> of accessible personal files from one healthy Windows computer to one new Windows 11 computer, with a current usable backup. The package covers local Ivanhoe/Eaglemont call-out and up to three onsite hours.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">It includes the agreed setup, one supported browser, up to five supported applications with valid licences, connection to existing Wi-Fi and one working printer, representative-file checks and a written handover. Hardware, storage media, licences and subscriptions are additional.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Multi-user, cross-platform, inaccessible-data and larger moves need different scope. Data recovery, account recovery, malware remediation, old-device erasure/disposal and exact recreation of every setting are not included. Provider downloads or cloud synchronisation may continue after the visit. Confirm the complete current service boundaries before booking.</p>
</aside>
<h2 class="mt-12 mb-5 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">Agree what “finished” means</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Choose a few representative files and everyday tasks from your essentials list. These become handover checks, not a guarantee that sampling proves every byte transferred. Keep a list of exceptions or work that will continue afterwards.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Our <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/guides/new-computer-handover-checks/">post-move checklist</a> helps you prepare those questions. Keep the old computer and original files until you understand the result; disposal is a separate decision.</p>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">If you have not yet decided whether to replace the old computer, start with <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/guides/slow-computer-fix-upgrade-replace/">fix, upgrade or replace</a>. When you are ready, <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/services/new-computer-setup-data-transfer-ivanhoe/">ask whether the Standard Windows Move fits</a>. Scope and availability are confirmed before an appointment is booked.</p>
